---
---

<section class="section principles-section reveal" id="principles">
  <!-- Wavy connecting background path -->
  <svg
    class="principles__line"
    viewBox="0 0 1440 1200"
    preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
    aria-hidden="true"
    focusable="false"
  >
    <defs>
      <linearGradient
        id="prinGrad"
        gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        x1="0"
        y1="0"
        x2="1440"
        y2="1200"
      >
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8"></stop>
        <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#0284c7"></stop>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#0ea5e9"></stop>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path
      id="principles-line-path"
      d="M -40,110 C 380,88 560,250 700,382 C 848,522 1322,540 1332,720 C 1342,902 500,878 380,1000 C 290,1092 480,1182 900,1158"
      fill="none"
      stroke="url(#prinGrad)"
      stroke-width="24"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
      opacity="0.25"
    ></path>
  </svg>

  <div class="container principles__inner">
    <div class="principles__head">
      <div class="principles__kicker">
        <span class="principles__kicker-sq"></span> OUR PHILOSOPHY
      </div>
      <h2 class="principles__title">
        Three Ideas Behind <span class="text-gradient">Everything We Build</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="principles__lede">
        N3 is built on three core engineering principles that shape how we work and what we create.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="principles-grid">
      <article class="principle-card">
        <div class="principle-card__head">
          <span class="principle-card__num">01</span>
          <h3 class="principle-card__title">Next</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="principle-card__desc">
          Building future-ready technology that adapts to changing business needs and emerging opportunities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="principle-card">
        <div class="principle-card__head">
          <span class="principle-card__num">02</span>
          <h3 class="principle-card__title">Network</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="principle-card__desc">
          Connecting people, processes, and platforms through seamless digital systems.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="principle-card">
        <div class="principle-card__head">
          <span class="principle-card__num">03</span>
          <h3 class="principle-card__title">Navigate</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="principle-card__desc">
          Simplifying complexity through thoughtful engineering, practical innovation, and intuitive experiences.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="principles-summary">
      <h3 class="principles-summary__title">Why N3 Global Tech</h3>
      <p class="principles-summary__highlight">Businesses don't need another agency promising transformation. They need engineers who've actually shipped and run the systems.</p>
      <p>
        We don't just build software for clients — we run our own SaaS products in production, which means every system we design is shaped by what actually breaks at scale, not what looks good in a pitch deck.
      </p>
      <p>
        Custom platform, SaaS product, or full operations overhaul — we build for what happens after launch, not launch day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .principles-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 3.75rem 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .principles__line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .principles__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .principles__head {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
  }

  .principles__kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }

  .principles__kicker-sq {
    width: 6.5px;
    height: 6.5px;
    background-color: #0284c7;
    display: inline-block;
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .principles__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 450;
    color: #0f172a;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .principles__lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .principle-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
  }

  .principle-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: #38bdf8;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.12);
  }

  .principle-card__head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .principle-card__num {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, sans-serif);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0ea5e9;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .principle-card__title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 450;
    color: #0f172a;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principle-card__desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principles-summary {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
  }

  .principles-summary__title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem);
    font-weight: 450;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .principles-summary__highlight {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--heading-sm, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--gray-900);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .principles-summary p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--body-lg, 1.125rem);
    color: var(--gray-600);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principles-summary p + p {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .principles-summary a {
    color: #0284c7;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .principles-summary a:hover {
    color: #0ea5e9;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .principles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .principles-section {
      padding: 2.75rem 0;
    }
    .principle-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
